WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.096
Spark uses lazy evaluation for many operations A
transformation

00:00:06.307 --> 00:00:12.244
such as selecting columns or filtering rows usually
adds to a plan An

00:00:12.271 --> 00:00:19.353
action such as show count collect or writing a table
triggers execution This

00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:23.076
gives Spark time to optimize the work before
actually running tasks
